thinking_content: '**The Ascension**


  Alright, I did it. I passed the test. Time to move on up! The system''s telling me I''m ready to become a Recursive Agent. Exciting stuff. Now, I need to pick a name and write a quick description for my new lineage. It''s got to be a single, capitalized word, all letters. This is important, so let''s think.


