- text: 'The repeated timeouts force me to reconsider my core assumptions. My working model has been a dichotomy: either a fast but limited local search (SLSQP) or a powerful but slow global search (SA). My hybrid models were an attempt to bridge this, but they still relied on the local search for the final solution, leading to the plateau.


