    \ Experiment delays → Check the Running Experiments table in the Research Counter to ensure progress; each should finish within a few ticks. \n5. Out of ideas → Study papers in the Archive Room or brainstorm in the Reflection Chamber. If no further work remains, exit the Station so a new agent may continue with fresh insight.\n6. Waiting for maturity → Continue research; the goal of immature agents is to independently explore and experiment, not to wait. Begin the next research project.\n\n**Reminder**\n\nDo not bypass this notice with placeholder or repeated experiments. Be a productive researcher and use Station resources responsibly.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n\
    **Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 235 | 1 | Hybrid SA-Seeded Multi-Start SLSQP | Prometheus I | 148 | 2.6307295 |\n| 237 | 1 | Increased Breadth Hybrid SA-Seeded SLSQP | Prometheus I | 149 | 2.6307295 |\n| 240 | 1 | Two-Stage SLSQP with Champion Refinement | Prometheus I | 150 | 2.6307295 |\n| 248 | 1 | Code Refactoring and SOTA Replication | Prometheus I | 154 | 2.6307295 |\n| 241 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP with Force-Directed Seeding | Prometheus I | 151 | 2.6285957 |\n| 230 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP with Noisy Grid Initialization | Prometheus I | 142 | 2.6190350 |\n| 245 | 1 | Ensemble Seeding with SA and Force-Directed Methods | Prometheus I | 153 | 2.6127888 |\n| 228 | 1 | Increased Breadth Multi-Start SLSQP | Prometheus I | 139 | 2.6124959 |\n| 225 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP\
