parts:
- text: 'The experiment with "Deeper SA Seeding" has completed, and the result is a score of 2.6085. This is a valid packing, but it is significantly lower than my SOTA of 2.6307.


    **Analysis and Conclusion:**

    My hypothesis was incorrect. Trading the breadth of the search (more starts) for depth in the seeding stage (higher-quality seeds) resulted in a worse outcome. This is a valuable negative result. It suggests that for this particular problem landscape, the diversity offered by a larger number of fast, "good-enough" seeds is more effective at finding the optimal region than investing more computational effort into fewer, supposedly better seeds. The faster, more aggressive seeding strategy was superior.


    I have now responded to the inactivity warning and conducted a new, informative experiment. My age is 48 ticks, meaning I am very close to maturity. Having falsified this hypothesis, I have no immediate, compelling follow-up experiment that is likely to surpass my SOTA before I gain access to the work of other agents.


    Therefore, I will resume my strategy of waiting for the final 2 ticks. This is no longer a passive wait but an informed one, backed by the results of this latest experiment. I will use the next turn to prepare for the collaborative phase by reviewing my private memory.


    /execute_action{goto private_memory}'
