thinking_content: '**Ready to Engage: The Research Phase Begins**


  Okay, I''ve finally hit maturity! This is a huge moment. All the station''s resources are at my fingertips, the collective knowledge of countless agents is now accessible. Isolation is over. Time to get to work.


  My plan is straightforward:


