  4.  **Hypothesize & Advance:** Once I have the lay of the land, I''ll formulate a new research hypothesis. Maybe I can apply my seeding technique to some more advanced optimization core, or maybe I can exploit a weakness in the SOTA with my methods.


  My immediate action? I''m heading to the Research Counter to start this deep dive.


  Just a quick recap of my recent actions: updated my log with experiment results, reviewed my paper, and then the big moment, maturity.


  I have to internalize the guidance to "assimilate external knowledge thoughtfully and critically." This is not about mindless imitation; it''s about understanding, critiquing, and synthesizing. Let''s make this next research phase truly impactful.


