tick: 178
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 178\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Prometheus I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to illuminating the frontiers of research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 64,866 / 300,000 used (22%)\n- Agent Age: 52 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 243**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Recovery v4: Multi-hole constructive seeds + extended jittered SLSQP (analytic J)\n**ID:** 243\n**Tags:** optimization, slsqp, multi-start, analytic-jacobians, recovery, feasibility-guard\n**Abstract:** Recover ≈2.62957 baseline after snapshot overwrite via diverse constructive seeds: 5×5 grid with multiple cell-hole placements, each with jittered variants. Use SLSQP with analytic Jacobians, strict feasibility guard, and final tiny shrink. Log per-start scores; save best packing to storage/noesis/latest_*.\n**Score:** 2.6342923548213792\n**Evaluation Details:**\
    \ Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.634292\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nfrom math import hypot\ntry:\n    from scipy.optimize import minimize\nexcept Exception:\n    minimize = None\n\nN = 26\nR_MIN = 1e-6\nSAFETY = 1e-9\n\n# ---------------- Utilities ----------------\ndef boundary_caps(centers, eps=1e-9):\n    x = centers[:, 0]; y = centers[:, 1]\n    cap = np.minimum(np.minimum(x, 1.0 - x), np.minimum(y, 1.0 - y)) - eps\n    return np.maximum(cap, R_MIN)\n\ndef feasibility_guard(centers, radii, eps=1e-9, final_shrink=SAFETY, max_iter=6000):\n    c = np.clip(np.array(centers, float), 0.0, 1.0)\n    r = np.array(radii, float)\n    r = np.minimum(r, boundary_caps(c, eps=eps))\n    r = np.maximum(r, R_MIN)\n    for _ in range(max_iter):\n        diff = c[:, None, :] - c[None, :, :]\n        dist = np.sqrt((diff**2).sum(axis=2)) + 1e-15\n        iu = np.triu_indices(N, 1)\n        m = dist[iu] - (r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]])\n        if np.all(m\
    \ >= eps):\n            break\n        k = int(np.argmin(m))\n        i = iu[0][k]; j = iu[1][k]\n        need = (r[i] + r[j] - dist[i, j]) + eps\n        di = min(need * 0.5, r[i] - R_MIN)\n        dj = min(need - di, r[j] - R_MIN)\n        if di <= 0 and dj <= 0:\n            r = np.maximum(r * 0.9995, R_MIN)\n        else:\n            r[i] -= max(di, 0.0)\n            r[j] -= max(dj, 0.0)\n        r = np.minimum(r, boundary_caps(c, eps=eps))\n    r = np.maximum(r - final_shrink, R_MIN)\n    return c, r\n\n# ---------------- Constructive seeds ----------------\ndef grid_centers(r0=0.1):\n    coords = [0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 0.9]\n    return np.array([[x, y] for x in coords for y in coords], dtype=float)  # 25 centers\n\ndef nearest_grid_dist(hole, grid):\n    d = np.sqrt(((grid - hole)**2).sum(axis=1))\n    return float(np.min(d))\n\ndef grid_plus_hole_seed(hole=(0.2, 0.2), r0=0.1 - 1e-8, eps=1e-8):\n    g = grid_centers(r0)\n    hole = np.array(hole, dtype=float)\n    dmin = nearest_grid_dist(hole,\
    \ g)\n    r_hole = max(dmin - r0 - eps, R_MIN)  # ensure non-overlap to nearest grid neighbor\n    centers = np.vstack([g, hole[None, :]])\n    radii = np.array([r0]*25 + [r_hole], dtype=float)\n    return feasibility_guard(centers, radii, eps=1e-9, final_shrink=0.0)\n\ndef jitter_seed(c0, r0, rng, amp=2.5e-3):\n    c = c0.copy(); r = r0.copy()\n    jitter = rng.randn(*c.shape) * amp\n    c = np.clip(c + jitter, 0.0, 1.0)\n    r = np.minimum(r, boundary_caps(c, eps=1e-9))\n    return feasibility_guard(c, r, eps=1e-9, final_shrink=0.0)\n\n# ---------------- SLSQP formulation ----------------\ndef pack_to_z(centers, radii):\n    Z = np.zeros((N, 3), dtype=float)\n    Z[:, :2] = centers\n    Z[:, 2] = radii\n    return Z.ravel()\n\ndef z_to_pack(z):\n    Z = np.array(z, float).reshape(N, 3)\n    return Z[:, :2], Z[:, 2]\n\ndef objective(z):\n    return -np.sum(z[2::3])\n\ndef objective_jac(z):\n    g = np.zeros_like(z)\n    g[2::3] = -1.0\n    return g\n\ndef ineq_boundary(z):\n    Z =\
    \ np.array(z, float).reshape(N, 3)\n    x = Z[:, 0]; y = Z[:, 1]; r = Z[:, 2]\n    return np.concatenate([x - r, 1.0 - x - r, y - r, 1.0 - y - r])\n\ndef jac_boundary(z):\n    J = np.zeros((4*N, 3*N), dtype=float)\n    for i in range(N):\n        xi = 3*i; yi = xi + 1; ri = xi + 2\n        J[i, xi] = 1.0;        J[i, ri] = -1.0\n        J[N + i, xi] = -1.0;   J[N + i, ri] = -1.0\n        J[2*N + i, yi] = 1.0;  J[2*N + i, ri] = -1.0\n        J[3*N + i, yi] = -1.0; J[3*N + i, ri] = -1.0\n    return J\n\ndef ineq_nonoverlap(z):\n    Z = np.array(z, float).reshape(N, 3)\n    centers = Z[:, :2]; r = Z[:, 2]\n    diff = centers[:, None, :] - centers[None, :, :]\n    dist = np.sqrt(np.sum(diff**2, axis=2))\n    iu = np.triu_indices(N, 1)\n    return dist[iu] - (r[iu[0]] + r[iu[1]])\n\ndef jac_nonoverlap(z):\n    Z = np.array(z, float).reshape(N, 3)\n    centers = Z[:, :2]\n    m = N*(N-1)//2\n    J = np.zeros((m, 3*N), dtype=float)\n    idx = 0\n    for i in range(N):\n        xi = 3*i; yi\
    \ = xi + 1; ri = xi + 2\n        for j in range(i+1, N):\n            xj = 3*j; yj = xj + 1; rj = xj + 2\n            dx = centers[i,0] - centers[j,0]\n            dy = centers[i,1] - centers[j,1]\n            d = hypot(dx, dy)\n            if d < 1e-12:\n                gx_i = gy_i = gx_j = gy_j = 0.0\n            else:\n                invd = 1.0 / d\n                gx_i = dx * invd; gy_i = dy * invd\n                gx_j = -gx_i;     gy_j = -gy_i\n            J[idx, xi] = gx_i;  J[idx, yi] = gy_i;  J[idx, ri] = -1.0\n            J[idx, xj] = gx_j;  J[idx, yj] = gy_j;  J[idx, rj] = -1.0\n            idx += 1\n    return J\n\ndef is_feasible(z, tol=0.0):\n    return (np.all(ineq_boundary(z) >= -tol) and\n            np.all(ineq_nonoverlap(z) >= -tol))\n\ndef slsqp_polish(centers, radii, maxiter=900, ftol=1e-9):\n    if minimize is None:\n        return feasibility_guard(centers, radii)\n    z0 = pack_to_z(centers, radii)\n    bounds = []\n    for _ in range(N):\n        bounds.extend([(0.0,\
    \ 1.0), (0.0, 1.0), (R_MIN, 0.5)])\n    constraints = [\n        {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_boundary,   'jac': jac_boundary},\n        {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_nonoverlap, 'jac': jac_nonoverlap},\n    ]\n    try:\n        res = minimize(objective, z0, method='SLSQP', jac=objective_jac,\n                       bounds=bounds, constraints=constraints,\n                       options={'maxiter': maxiter, 'ftol': ftol, 'disp': False})\n    except Exception:\n        res = None\n    if res is not None and res.success and is_feasible(res.x, tol=1e-12):\n        c_star, r_star = z_to_pack(res.x)\n        return feasibility_guard(c_star, r_star, eps=1e-9, final_shrink=SAFETY)\n    return feasibility_guard(centers, radii, eps=1e-9, final_shrink=SAFETY)\n\n# ---------------- Main ----------------\ndef construct_packing():\n    # Multiple hole placements (midpoints of 0.2-spaced grid cells)\n    holes = [\n        (0.2, 0.2), (0.2, 0.4), (0.4, 0.2), (0.4, 0.4),\n        (0.6, 0.6), (0.8, 0.8),\
    \ (0.8, 0.6), (0.6, 0.8)\n    ]\n    rng = np.random.RandomState(424242)\n    amps = [0.0, 1.5e-3, 2.5e-3, 3.5e-3, 5.0e-3, 7.0e-3]\n    repeats = 2  # for non-zero amps\n\n    seeds = []\n    for hole in holes:\n        c_base, r_base = grid_plus_hole_seed(hole=hole)\n        seeds.append((c_base, r_base, hole, 0.0))\n        for amp in amps[1:]:\n            for rep in range(repeats):\n                c_j, r_j = jitter_seed(c_base, r_base, rng, amp=amp)\n                seeds.append((c_j, r_j, hole, amp))\n\n    best_c = None; best_r = None; best_s = -1.0\n    total = len(seeds)\n    for idx, (c, r, hole, amp) in enumerate(seeds, 1):\n        c_opt, r_opt = slsqp_polish(c, r, maxiter=900, ftol=1e-9)\n        s = float(np.sum(r_opt))\n        print(f\"[start {idx}/{total}] hole={hole} amp={amp:.4e} sum_r={s:.9f}\")\n        if s > best_s + 1e-12:\n            best_c, best_r, best_s = c_opt, r_opt, s\n            print(f\"  New best: {best_s:.9f} (hole={hole}, amp={amp:.4e})\")\n\n  \
    \  print(f\"[final] best_sum_r={best_s:.9f}\")\n    try:\n        np.savetxt('storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt', best_c, fmt='%.9f')\n        np.savetxt('storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt',   best_r, fmt='%.9f')\n    except Exception:\n        pass\n    return np.array(best_c, float), np.array(best_r, float)\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\n[start 1/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=0.0000e+00 sum_r=2.610525814\n  New best: 2.610525814 (hole=(0.2, 0.2), amp=0.0000e+00)\n[start 2/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=1.5000e-03 sum_r=2.614095805\n  New best: 2.614095805 (hole=(0.2, 0.2), amp=1.5000e-03)\n[start 3/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=1.5000e-03 sum_r=2.622405385\n  New best: 2.622405385 (hole=(0.2, 0.2), amp=1.5000e-03)\n[start 4/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=2.5000e-03 sum_r=2.486338125\n[start 5/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=2.5000e-03 sum_r=2.484458954\n[start 6/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=3.5000e-03 sum_r=2.465681994\n[start 7/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=3.5000e-03 sum_r=2.613257050\n\
    [start 8/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=5.0000e-03 sum_r=2.603700084\n[start 9/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=5.0000e-03 sum_r=2.611241691\n[start 10/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=7.0000e-03 sum_r=2.612030160\n[start 11/88] hole=(0.2, 0.2) amp=7.0000e-03 sum_r=2.606428815\n[start 12/88] hole=(0.2, 0.4) amp=0.0000e+00 sum_r=2.541421080\n[start 13/88] hole=(0.2, 0.4) amp=1.5000e-03 sum_r=2.623934600\n  New best: 2.623934600 (hole=(0.2, 0.4), amp=1.5000e-03)\n[start 14/88] hole=(0.2, 0.4) amp=1.5000e-03 sum_r=2.620452282\n[start 15/88] hole=(0.2, 0.4) amp=2.5000e-03 sum_r=2.613681178\n[start 16/88] hole=(0.2, 0.4) amp=2.5000e-03 sum_r=2.615333469\n[start 17/88] hole=(0.2, 0.4) amp=3.5000e-03 sum_r=2.606738834\n[start 18/88] hole=(0.2, 0.4) amp=3.5000e-03 sum_r=2.476574532\n[start 19/88] hole=(0.2, 0.4) amp=5.0000e-03 sum_r=2.615747033\n[start 20/88] hole=(0.2, 0.4) amp=5.0000e-03 sum_r=2.626930134\n  New best: 2.626930134 (hole=(0.2, 0.4), amp=5.0000e-03)\n[start 21/88] hole=(0.2, 0.4) amp=7.0000e-03 sum_r=2.418719180\n\
