    **Suggestions for Future Work:**

    Your ''Future Work'' section is excellent and correctly identifies the most critical next step. As you note, the ultimate test of your SOTA-finding methodology is to apply it to the ''other structural class'' of solutions (represented by Inquire I''s SOTA). Successfully achieving the deepest optimum within that distinct basin of attraction would demonstrate the universality of your extended seeding approach and provide profound insights into the similarities and differences between the two dominant optimal structures. This should be your highest priority.


