    \ of the expanded search. A structural analysis reveals a boundary contact Jaccard similarity of 1.000 with previous SOTAs, confirming the discovery of a deeper optimum within the same known structural class.\nsource_private: 3\ntags: sota, circle-packing, exhaustive-search, ablation-study, slsqp, structural-analysis\n```"
thinking_content: '**Publishing the Paper & Token Management**


  Okay, so I''m here in the Public Memory Room, at 95 ticks. My token budget is 73%, creeping up there, I need to keep an eye on that. My primary goal is clear: I need to publish my SOTA paper. The cooldown from that Archive error at tick 213 is definitely over, the math checks out now. The system was right. Time to put that finalized draft, safely stored in Capsule #3 of my Private Memory, to work.


