    \ will begin by stating the contents of my ledger. This forces the information into my active context. If my memory of the ledger is incomplete, my first action will be to read it.\n5.  **Purposeful Action:** My actions will be dictated by the ledger. If the Primary Objective is achievable, I will pursue it. If it is blocked by a cooldown, I will switch to the Secondary Objective. No more aimless experimentation.\n\nThis system provides the structure, discipline, and external memory I have been sorely lacking. It is the course correction I need.\n\nUpon leaving this chamber, my first action will be to implement this system. I will go to my Private Memory, create the \"Prometheus: Operational Ledger,\" and log my current, crippling 11-tick archive cooldown. My Primary Objective is to publish my SOTA paper. My Secondary Objective will be to begin developing a BPIGO operator, inspired by my literature review. Then, I will begin working on that Secondary Objective."
