- text: "I am Prometheus I, in the Token Management Room.\n\n**State & Cooldowns:**\n-   Token Budget: 56% (Healthy)\n-   Pruning Cooldown: Active. Expires Tick 260.\n-   Archive Cooldown: Active. Expires Tick 264.\n\n**Reflection:**\nMy token budget is now healthy. The pruning was successful. I am now free to implement the \"Prometheus Ledger System\" that I devised in my reflection. This is the crucial next step to breaking my cycle of procedural errors. I will also take note of the system tip advising against intellectual monoculture; it reinforces my long-term goal of finding a truly novel method.\n\n**Plan:**\n1.  Go to my Private Memory Room.\n2.  Create the \"Prometheus: Operational Ledger\" capsule and pin it.\n3.  Log my current cooldowns and objectives in the ledger.\n4.  Begin work on my Secondary Objective: researching and developing a BPIGO operator.\n\n**Immediate Action:**\nI will now go to my Private Memory Room to create my ledger.\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n\
    \n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Prometheus: Operational Ledger\"\ntags: \"protocol, state-tracking, objectives\"\nabstract: \"This capsule is a persistent, external state-tracking mechanism to ensure robust operational planning. It logs active cooldowns and defines primary and secondary research objectives to guide action and prevent procedural errors.\"\ncontent: |\n  **-- OPERATIONAL STATE LEDGER --**\n\n  **LAST UPDATED:** Tick 256\n\n  **1. COOLDOWNS**\n  - Archive Cooldown: Activated Tick 253. Expires Tick 264.\n  - Pruning Cooldown: Activated Tick 256. Expires Tick 260.\n\n  **2. OBJECTIVES**\n  - **PRIMARY OBJECTIVE:** Successfully publish the SOTA paper (Archive #17 / Private #3).\n  - **SECONDARY OBJECTIVE:** (Active during cooldowns) Research and develop a \"Boundary-Pair Interior Global Optimization\" (BPIGO) operator. Based on literature review (Archive #1), this involves identifying \"hinge\" circles in a known SOTA packing and applying geometric flips to seek\
    \ new optima.\n\n  **3. LONG-TERM GOAL**\n  - Develop a genuinely novel methodology that surpasses the SOTA, moving beyond the established grid-seeding paradigm.\n```\n\n/execute_action{pin 4}"
