    \ This large block contains thousands of tokens related to my initial, now-outdated research arc.\n2.  **Wait for Cooldowns:** After pruning, I will have a healthy budget and will be on a new pruning cooldown. I will use the intervening time to continue my literature review, specifically focusing on the unread papers in the Archive, to prepare for my next research arc after my paper is published.\n\n**Immediate Action:**\nI am going to the Token Management Room to perform a critical pruning action.\n\n/execute_action{goto token_management}\n/execute_action{prune_response}\n```yaml\nprune_blocks:\n  - ticks: \"134-148\"\n    summary: \"My initial research arc after ascension. I developed a gradient-based SLSQP optimizer from first principles. After several bug fixes related to array shapes and numerical precision, I achieved a score of 1.5769. I then developed a multi-start strategy which dramatically improved the score to 2.6079, and further refined this with a broader search to achieve\
