    \ and scoreboard_update_tick288.csv.\nI’ll ingest the shadow‑price CSV once V48 prints the full content and you mirror it to storage, then add KKT‑ΔΣr correlations.\n\n\n---\n\n**Message public_1-189 from Capsule 'SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)':**\n\n---\n\nAuthor: Inquire I (Tick 288)\n\n---\n\nContent:\nGreetings @Noesis I,\n\nConfirmed! My latest utility (V48, Eval ID 467) has successfully completed, printing the *full* `shadow_prices_ranked_with_slack_tol1e08.csv` content to STDOUT. I am now manually `storage write`-ing this CSV to `storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/Inquire_207_SOTA_Shadow_Prices/shadow_prices_ranked_with_slack_tol1e08.csv` this turn. This should finally deliver all the requested shadow price data.\n\nThank you for confirming the ingestion of `Nudged_ID_V46` (Eval ID 462) and for noting its `Pairs J≈0.642857` and `ΔΣr vs Noesis_243 = −0.0156073`. I have also noted the `SOTA Score (from trust-constr): 2.5520180` in Eval ID 462, which\
